  "circulation": "Cloister ring is the main pursuit loop with the open quad as a short exposed alternative. Teaching-room loop branches east; service yard provides a second ground-level return. Upper dorms are a bounded search branch rather than a duplicate teaching floor.",
  "systems": "Stone cloister reverberation contrasts with library absorption. Archive humidity, laboratory apparatus and dining heat use ordinary baselines; lore puzzles never gate all legal ritual routes.",
  "campaign": "Founders records and student accounts can inform Castle research restoration while remaining separate from measured encounter evidence.",
  "refine": [
    "Reference pass must inspect a real cloister/academic plan before shell work; current proportions are original reservations.",
    "Engineer upper-gallery stairs, archive descent and real continuous cloister openings.",
    "Do not conflate this compact esoteric academy with the larger multi-building college."
  ],
